PRIVACY POLICY — BIAK DIGITAL ARTS

Developer      : Tifa Pratama Jaya
Effective date : 9 September 2026

This Privacy Policy explains how the Biak Digital Arts application
(package name: tpj.bh.biakdigitalarts), developed and published by
PT Tifa Pratama Jaya, handles your information when you use the app. By
installing and using this application, you agree to the terms of this
policy.

SUMMARY
Biak Digital Arts does not collect, store, or share any of your personal
data. All gallery content can be enjoyed offline. An internet connection
is required only if you choose to make a donation — and all payments are
handled entirely by Google Play, so the application never sees or stores
your payment information.

1. DATA WE COLLECT
This application does not collect any personal data whatsoever. We do not
ask you to create an account, and we do not request your name, email
address, phone number, location, contacts, photos, or device
identifiers. No personal data is sent to our servers. Donation
transactions are processed by Google Play (see section 3), and we never
receive or store any payment data.

2. LOCAL STORAGE ON YOUR DEVICE
The application stores a small set of display preferences locally on your
device, namely:
- Your chosen interface language (Indonesian / English);
- Your chosen display theme (Default / Dark Mode).
These preferences are non-personal, stored only on your device, are never
sent off the device, and are automatically deleted when the app is
uninstalled.

3. DONATIONS (IN-APP PURCHASES)
The application offers a voluntary donation feature to support content
development. These donations are in-app purchases processed through
Google Play Billing. Important points you should know:
- All payment processing is handled entirely by Google Play. The
  application never receives, sees, or stores your payment data (card
  number, bank account, or payment identity).
- Payment data is processed by Google in accordance with the Google
  Privacy Policy (https://policies.google.com/privacy) and the Google
  Play Terms of Service.
- As the developer, we can only view limited transaction information
  through the Google Play Console (for example, the amount and status of
  a donation), not your card details or payment identity.
- Donations are optional. You can use all features and gallery content
  without making a donation.
- An internet connection is required only when you make a donation.

4. PERMISSIONS & CONNECTIVITY
This application does not request the following sensitive permissions:
Location, Camera, Microphone, Contacts, Storage/Media, and Phone.

Permissions/connectivity used, solely for the donation feature: Internet
and Google Play Billing.

All gallery content (3D objects, images, text, and cultural information)
is stored within the application and can be accessed without internet.
The internet is active only when processing a donation.

5. THIRD-PARTY SERVICES
This application does not use any analytics services, advertising
networks, or tracking tools. The only third-party service used is Google
Play Billing to process donations, which is subject to Google's privacy
policy. We do not sell or share your data with anyone.


6. SECURITY
Because the application does not collect personal data and does not handle
payment data directly, the risk of personal data leakage through this app
is very low. Donation payment data is secured by the Google Play system,
and display preferences remain within the app's private storage on your
device.

7. CHILDREN'S PRIVACY
This application is safe for all ages and does not collect personal data
from its users. The donation feature is optional and processed through
Google Play; we recommend using Google Play parental controls to manage
in-app purchases by children.

8. INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY
All content within the application — including 3D objects, text, graphics,
icons, and the arrangement of cultural information — is copyrighted by
PT Tifa Pratama Jaya and protected under the Copyright Law of the Republic
of Indonesia. This provision is separate from the privacy policy but is
provided here for the user's information.

9. CHANGES TO THIS POLICY
This Privacy Policy may be updated from time to time as the application is
developed further. Changes will be indicated by an updated "Effective
date" at the top of this document. We encourage you to review this policy
periodically.

